
============================================
  17HS19-2004-ME1K ENCODER BENCH TEST
============================================
TB6600: PUL D4, DIR D5, ENA D6 (LOW move / HIGH idle)
AM26LV32E outputs: A D2, B D3, Z D18
TB6600: 400 pulses/rev; current about 1.0 A RMS.
Keep the shaft unloaded and clear before motion.

ENCODER BENCH-TEST COMMANDS
  STATUS              Show encoder inputs and measurements
  ZERO                Reset encoder and index counts
  TAG <label>         Label the next capture (letters, digits, _ or -)
  F <pulses>          Forward constant-speed move (100 PPS)
  R <pulses>          Reverse constant-speed move (100 PPS)
  RF <pulses> <pps>   Forward move with accel/decel
  RR <pulses> <pps>   Reverse move with accel/decel
  HELP                Show this command list

CSV format: ENC_LOG,sequence,capture_label,type,direction,command_pulses,target_pps,duration_ms,encoder_before,encoder_after,encoder_delta,expected_magnitude,magnitude_error,index_before,index_after
